    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "to the altar",
      "rationale": "Kĩrĩra gĩkũrirĩtwo mũgiro mwene — 'igũrũ rĩaku' — ti mũndũ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "mystery",
      "subject": "prophecy of Yociayahu",
      "rationale": "Rĩĩtwa rĩa mũrũ ũrĩa ndangĩahikũ rĩngĩhootwo na ũhoro ũrĩa wĩ ihinda rĩraya — ũndũ wĩ ũthingu wa thutha."
